- SweetWatchdog.cpp: AppleBaseband, same accept-all user client as AppleIPAppender, log "LV BB:"
- made by xnu/src/mk_baseband.py

diff --git a/iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetWatchdog.cpp b/iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetWatchdog.cpp
